('advanced-native-2031', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2031-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The studio offered material support but restricted time for her own drawings, and her decision was still open."],"options":["The agreement protected regular time for independent drawings, and that was the benefit she valued most.","The studio offered material support but restricted time for her own drawings, and her decision was still open.","The generous materials established that she had full freedom to pursue her own drawings.","She had already left the studio and returned every item before making the comparison."]},"advanced-native-2031-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["It felt like a golden cage because the support came without time for the drawings she wanted to pursue.","The materials were generous, but the agreement did not leave room for her independent work.","Something she valued was constrained despite the comfortable setting.","A well-equipped room did not answer her need for time to choose her own projects."],"options":["It felt like a golden cage because the support came without time for the drawings she wanted to pursue.","The materials were generous, but the agreement did not leave room for her independent work.","Something she valued was constrained despite the comfortable setting.","A well-equipped room did not answer her need for time to choose her own projects."]},"advanced-native-2031-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Good benefits alone do not make the role a golden cage; this account also describes protected choices and time."],"options":["Good benefits alone do not make the role a golden cage; this account also describes protected choices and time.","The account treats the option to refuse extra projects as merely informal, rather than a choice explicitly included in the arrangement.","Her independent drawing time is described only as a hope, not an agreed part of the arrangement."]},"advanced-native-2031-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answ