('advanced-native-2032', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2032-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["The club could help the speaker repair possessions, but beginner access to the weekly sessions still needed checking."],"options":["The club could help the speaker repair possessions, but beginner access to the weekly sessions still needed checking.","The speaker had already joined after confirming that every weekly session was open to beginners.","The speaker wanted the club mainly to replace broken possessions with newly bought ones.","The club had confirmed beginner access, while the speaker had not yet identified any personal reason for joining."]},"advanced-native-2032-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The useful question is whether I can practise the repair habits I want, not just whether the club owns tools.","It might support the kind of life I want to build through repair rather than replacement, if beginners can use the sessions.","I would compare the chance to learn repairs with the actual access offered to someone starting out.","Mending possessions matters to me, so I need to know whether the weekly activities include beginners."],"options":["The useful question is whether I can practise the repair habits I want, not just whether the club owns tools.","It might support the kind of life I want to build through repair rather than replacement, if beginners can use the sessions.","I would compare the chance to learn repairs with the actual access offered to someone starting out.","Mending possessions matters to me, so I need to know whether the weekly activities include beginners."]},"advanced-native-2032-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["A title alone does not establish that the role supports the kind of life they want to build; the weekend pattern still needs checking."],"options":["A title alone does not establish that the role supports the kind of life they want to build; the weekend pattern still needs checking.","I would accept on the strength of