('advanced-native-2033', '["phrase"]'::jsonb, '{"advanced-native-2033-v1-audio":{"type":"mc","answers":["Rejecting all new songs was unlikely to freeze changing tastes, while rehearsal rules could still be agreed."],"options":["The speaker said that any rehearsal rule must prevent useful musical change.","The committee had already persuaded every member to keep the same tastes permanently.","The members had agreed to stop bringing unfamiliar music before the committee met.","Rejecting all new songs was unlikely to freeze changing tastes, while rehearsal rules could still be agreed."]},"advanced-native-2033-v2-reply":{"type":"mc","answers":["The committee could choose rehearsal arrangements without controlling every musical interest.","The scale of the changing influences went beyond the committee’s song list.","It felt like trying to hold back the tide while members kept encountering different music.","A blanket refusal did not stop the influences shaping members’ tastes outside rehearsal."],"options":["The committee could choose rehearsal arrangements without controlling every musical interest.","The scale of the changing influences went beyond the committee’s song list.","It felt like trying to hold back the tide while members kept encountering different music.","A blanket refusal did not stop the influences shaping members’ tastes outside rehearsal."]},"advanced-native-2033-v1-scene":{"type":"mc","answers":["Checking permission for one quotation is not by itself trying to hold back the tide of media change."],"options":["The temporary check establishes that the editor intends to prevent all new publishing formats.","The editor is postponing the whole issue until every quotation has been reviewed, rather than holding one private quotation for permission.","Checking permission for one quotation is not by itself trying to hold back the tide of media change."]},"advanced-native-2033-v1-contrast":{"type":"mc","answers":["Every part of the change is beneficial and no p